---
title: Requirements
description: Who the toolkit serves and what it depends on
---

# Requirements

Repository maintainers install a shared governance rule set into their own projects and keep it current as the catalog moves.

## Users

- Maintainers adopting the shared rule set for the first time
- Maintainers updating an installed copy against a newer catalog

## External dependencies

- GitHub, which hosts the rule catalog the installer reads
- The target project's own repository, which the installer writes into
